<!--
  M1K3's mark — the 5×7, 17-cell pixel M (the leading glyph of the wordmark,
  macos/tools/icons/brand/build_m_mark.py's ON-map, ported cell-for-cell so
  the shape can't drift from the Mac icon). Orange on the near-black
  background in ic_launcher_background.xml.

  Sized to 50% of the 108dp adaptive-icon canvas height so it clears the
  ~61%-diameter safe zone on every mask shape (circle, squircle, rounded
  square) without clipping.

  Finding 9 of the Android UX pass — replaces an unbranded Android Studio
  scaffold icon (concentric-ring placeholder art) that had never been
  swapped for M1K3's own identity.
-->
